  "description": "Engineered for fast-paced trail riding, the Vitus E-Sentier combines the agility and fun-loving nature of a traditional hardtail with the power of the Bafang M510 motor system.\n\nAt the heart of the E-Sentier is the Bafang M510 motor system with a maximum torque of 95Nm. We developed a close partnership with Bafang and tuned the system to perform exactly to our needs, effectively cherry-picking the best features and incorporating them into our drive unit.\n\nThe M510 system is powered by an integrated 630Wh battery and a display with five custom power modes — Eco, Eco-plus, Trail, Boost, and Race — giving the rider maximum options for adjusting range and on-trail performance.\n\nSpec wise, the Microshift Advent X 1x10 speed groupset combined with four piston Tektro disc brakes and a 140mm RockShox 35 Silver TK fork gives the rider the perfect balance of versatility and control.\n\nWhen it comes to wheels, size matters – but it's all about finding the perfect match for your riding style. For our smaller riders cruising on the size small, we've dialled in the agility with 27.5\" wheels. These wheels bring an extra dose of responsiveness, making quick turns and navigating tight spots a breeze. It's all about snappy handling and a nimble feel that suits riders looking to conquer trails with precision.\n\nFor medium, large and X-large riders, we've rolled out the big guns – 29\" wheels. These larger wheels bring a whole new level of momentum and stability to the game. The 29ers effortlessly roll over obstacles, providing a smoother ride that eats up rough terrain. It's all about maximising speed, maintaining momentum, and conquering the trail with confidence.\n\nThe E-Sentier's wheel size optimisation ensures that every rider, regardless of stature, gets the best possible ride. Choose your size and own the trail.\n\nRockShox 35 Silver TK suspension fork\n\nSmooth Bafang M510 motor produces 250W max power and 95Nm torque\n\nLong range 630Wh internal battery\n\nWide range Microshift Advent X 1x10 speed drivetrain\n\nPowerful Tektro 4 piston hydraulic disc brakes\n\nTubeless ready WTB rims with grippy WTB Vigilante Tyres",
